  "prefLabel": "Bcr 207.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 207.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) This part shall govern all proceedings conducted by the board except:\n\n(1) Rulemaking proceedings; and\n\n(2) Nonadjudicative investigations.\n\nSource. #8044, eff 2-17-04; ss by #8213, eff 11-22-04",
